## Quick Reference

### Import Paths
- `@/` → `src/`
- `@shared/` → `src/shared/`
- `@/components/ui` → shadcn/ui components
- `@/lib/utils` → Utility functions

### Common Utilities
- `cn()` - Merge Tailwind classes
- `createMessage()` - Create typed messages
- `getDomain()` - Extract domain from URL
- `processTitleTemplate()` - Process title templates
- `debugLog()` - Development logging

### Chrome APIs Used
- `chrome.tabs` - Tab management
- `chrome.storage` - Persistent storage
- `chrome.runtime` - Message passing
- `chrome.scripting` - Script injection
- `chrome.action` - Extension action
